{
  "id": "ru-dc8d7c247077.en",
  "jokeId": "ru-dc8d7c247077",
  "locale": "en",
  "title": "Fishing, Are We?",
  "location": "derevnya",
  "place": "river-lake",
  "cast": [
    "muzhik",
    "muzhik-ryzhy"
  ],
  "roles": {
    "muzhik": "everyman",
    "muzhik-ryzhy": "fisherman"
  },
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "l1",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "A man is cycling home to his village. It's hot, the road goes uphill, he's worn out. He decides to rest on the bridge.",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l2",
      "character": "muzhik",
      "text": "So, fishing, are we?",
      "emotion": "happy",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l3",
      "character": "muzhik",
      "text": "I said, fishing, are we?",
      "emotion": "surprised",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l4",
      "character": "muzhik",
      "text": "What, are you deaf? I'm asking: fishing, are we?",
      "emotion": "angry",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l5",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "The man spits, gets back on his bike and keeps pedalling uphill, drenched in sweat.",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l6",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "Two miles on, he looks back and sees the fisherman waving at him with all his might: come back, quick!",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.3,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l7",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "So he turns around and rolls back down.",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.8,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l8",
      "character": "muzhik-ryzhy",
      "text": "So, riding a bike, are we?",
      "emotion": "smug",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.8,
      "enter": [],
      "exit": [],
      "laugh": "big"
    }
  ],
